        defaultLabel: "ON",
        description: "Methane ice concentrated at poles and in cold regions, frozen at ~30 K. Color: pale tan-white #E8E0D8 with slight brown tint. Sparse patchy distribution (Worley freq 90.0, ~25% coverage). FBM 4-octave (freq 18.0, amplitude 0.09). Shader: additive overlay on base surface. Secondary ice component.",
