        description: "Low-density outer envelope of swept-up ISM hydrogen/helium; dominates shell outer regions. Rendered as smooth FBM layer (freq 1.5) forming shell boundary at radius ~0.015 ly beyond shock. Color #4A7FFF pale blue (synchrotron). Optically dominant; often only visible component in young SNR.",
