        description: "Speculative: hydrogen recombination produces #FF5540 Hα 656.3 nm line (weaker than oxygen but bright). When enabled, adds faint red overlay at shock front. Opacity 20%, Gaussian profile (width 0.005 ly). Real SNR images show Hα as important diagnostic. Visual realism gain ~8%.",
