        description: "Dark dust lanes (#3A2F28 dark brown) distributed randomly throughout (optical depth 0.5–2.0), particularly concentrated in star-forming regions. Rendered as 3-octave Simplex FBM (freq 3.5) with scattered high-opacity zones. Creates patchy obscuration.",
