        defaultLabel: "ON",
        description: "Associations of ~100–10,000 young stars (age 1–500 Myr) scattered throughout galaxy, particularly in star-forming regions. Rendered as bright #B0D8FF blue-white point cloud aggregates (density ~3–5 clusters per 5 kpc region) using sparse Worley distribution. Real: LMC 30 Doradus region hosts numerous clusters.",
