        name: "Supergiant Shell Rings",
        uniform: "u_supergiantShells",
        defaultOn: false,
        defaultLabel: "OFF",
        description: "Large expanding shells (radius 0.3–1.0 kpc, age ~10–100 Myr) carved by collective stellar winds and SNe from massive star clusters. When enabled, renders as faint ring boundaries (#FF6070 reddish, opacity 20%, thickness 0.05 kpc) at specific radii. Real: M82 shows prominent shells.",
