        defaultLabel: "OFF",
        description: "Milky Way thermal dust emission contaminating high-frequency CMB. Concentrated along galactic plane, especially in molecular cloud regions. Color: #C0A080 (dominates at ν > 300 GHz). Must be separated from CMB. BICEP2 2014 initially mistook dust B-modes for primordial signal. Rendered as warm-colored band along galactic plane.",
