        uniform: "u_cMBMask",
        defaultOn: false,
        defaultLabel: "OFF",
        description: "Regions of sky where galactic contamination is too strong to extract CMB signal. Masked in analysis: ~20–30% of sky (galactic plane region). Clean sky fraction: 70–80%. Rendered as grayed-out galactic zone #505050, with CMB visible in unmasked regions. Mask design balances sky coverage vs foreground contamination.",
