        description: "CMB photons originate from surface of last scattering: thin shell at z ≈ 1100 (age 380,000 years), thickness Δz ~80 (not infinitely thin). Everything inside this sphere occurred after photon decoupling. Rendered as translucent spherical shell #D0D0E0, opacity 0.05 at comoving distance 46 Gly (conformal). Observer at center. All of observable universe inside this sphere.",
