        description: "Visualization of proposed emission mechanism: bunched curvature radiation or synchrotron maser. Charge bunches: groups of ~10²⁵ particles radiating coherently (brightness temperature T_B ~ 10³⁶ K). Rendered as tight particle clumps along curved field lines, each emitting in-phase wavefronts. Constructive interference pattern shown as reinforced wave crests.",
